        public bool GearFitSkillLawFootInHideoutSiege = true; // the same rule for the whole-party weapon matching in battle (the skill check that gives the hardest usable piece to the most skilled man): in hideouts and siege assaults (in a sally-out or relief battle only the besiegers) a trooper whose template rides is matched as a man on foot, so he may get a long bow, a pike or another weapon that cannot be used from the saddle (off = always matched as a rider, as before)
