        // zamiana ROT, najemnik - para z puli weteranow), w bitwie gracza kon bez uprzezy schodzi, lord AI kupuje najtansze siodlo do zapasu, uprzaz idzie za koniem.
        // Dziala razem z CavalryNeedsMounts i TroopsFightWithOwnKitOnly (kon jako sztuka zbrojowni). Wylaczony = stan sprzed (sam kon wystarcza); linia logu liczy dalej
        public bool RiderNeedsHarness = true;              // a mounted soldier needs a saddle as well as a horse - any horse harness will do: raising a footman to a rider takes a spare harness from the baggage or the troop armoury (yours and the AI's alike), in your battles a rider whose horse has no harness fights on foot, AI lords buy the cheapest saddle for every rider who has a horse and none, a veteran takes his saddle along to the tavern and a mounted mercenary brings it back; heroes are not checked; works with Cavalry Needs Mounts and Troops Fight With Own Kit Only (off = a horse alone is enough, as before)

