        public bool CompanionHireByWage = true;            // a wanderer asks half the worth of his gear plus Companion Hire Days of his daily pay to join you, like the prest of a sell-sword, instead of the Banner Kings skill premium (estimate, not yet checked in a game: a Realm of Thrones companion who asked about 15 000 would ask about 2 600). His daily pay does not change
