        public bool PeaceReleaseAfterDay = true;           // when two realms make peace, the lords and ladies they hold captive go free a day later instead of at once - and only if the peace still holds by then. If the war is back within that day (Realm of Thrones declares its story wars again the same day), the captives stay captive, to be ransomed, to escape or to be freed in battle as in any war. The peace of a single house (a company leaving its master, a house leaving a realm) is unchanged. You and the AI alike. Off = captives go free the moment peace is made, as before
