        public bool DsCastleFolkPartNoArrears = true;      // with Ds Towns: the part of a castle's farm that its castle folk pay from their savings is paid only from what they hold above their hard-times reserve, and what they cannot pay is forgiven instead of written down as arrears - the same as a village's rent above its reserve. Such arrears left in an old save are paid from the folk's surplus at the first instalment and the rest is forgiven once. Towns keep their arrears as before. Off = as before
