        public bool WorksPayMarketShare = true;            // with District Works: your works are paid their true share of what the district's carts sell - the extra goods all go to market (the district eats the same as before), so your share is the extra's part of the goods sold, not of everything the district makes (which paid about a third of what the works window promised); the works window counts its expected income from the carts' real takings in every district. Off = the old, smaller share of the district's whole production
